    * Lyman-alpha forest (WDM mass): m_WDM > 3.3 keV (Viel+13, 2sig), > 5.3 (Irsic+17, 2sig), > 5.7 (Villasenor+24, 95%) -- the framework's 5.09 is inside the stated window, pressed from above.
